sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff (Cashier)
    actor Customer as Customer (At Counter)
    participant POS_UI as POS Client (/staff/pos): Boundary
    participant PosCtrl as PosStaffController: Boundary
    participant PosSvc as PosOrderService: Control
    participant DB as PrismaDatabase: Entity
    participant Printer as ThermalPrinter80mm: Boundary

    %% ================= STAGE 3: RECEIPT & THERMAL TICKET PRINTING =================
    Note over Staff, Printer: STAGE 3: Fetch receipt data & Trigger 80mm thermal print job
    POS_UI ->>+ PosCtrl: GET /staff/pos/orders/:orderId/receipt
    PosCtrl ->>+ PosSvc: getPosReceipt(staffContext, orderId)
    PosSvc ->>+ DB: findUnique Order (include seatOrders, productOrders, tickets, branch)
    DB -->>- PosSvc: Full Order Details (Cinema, Movie, Room, Seats, F&B, Barcode)
    PosSvc -->>- PosCtrl: PosReceiptRes (Complete receipt print payload)
    PosCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 200 OK (PosReceiptRes)

    Staff ->>+ POS_UI: Click "Print Tickets & Receipt"
    POS_UI ->>+ Printer: Send 80mm thermal print command (window.print() with auto-cut)
    Printer -->>- POS_UI: Output physical movie tickets & F&B collection slip
    POS_UI -->>- Staff: Printing completed
    Staff -->> Customer: Hand physical tickets and F&B receipt to customer
